+Configured launch allocates the lowest free public descriptor from a shared
+256-slot table, including stdio, immutable-image files, memory files, devices
+and pipes. Backend handles stay private. Native opens reserve a public slot
+before effects, and translated syscall arguments are restored at exit. The
