+supported; owned file mappings and successful subsequent exec are not.
+Native locks, leases and signal ownership are denied, including the existing
+EPERM refusal of signal-driven IO. Unsupported owned descriptor operations
+return EOPNOTSUPP without sending a private handle to the kernel.
